## 📦 SECTION 4: API RESPONSE ENVELOPE STANDARD

### 4.1 Unified Response Schema
ALL API responses MUST conform to this envelope:
{
  success: boolean,
  statusCode: number,
  message: string,
  data: T | null,
  meta?: PaginationMeta,        // for list endpoints
  errors?: ValidationErrorItem[], // for 422 errors
  traceId: string,              // UUID for log correlation
  timestamp: string             // ISO 8601
}

### 4.2 Global Response Interceptor
All successful responses are wrapped by a NestJS GlobalInterceptor.

### 4.3 Centralized Exception Filter
A GlobalExceptionFilter maps ALL errors to the ApiResponse envelope.
NEVER leak stack traces to the client in production.
ALWAYS log full error with traceId to structured logger (Pino).

