## 🧪 SECTION 6: TESTING STANDARDS

- Unit Tests: Every service method has a Jest unit test with mocked repositories.
- Integration Tests: Every controller endpoint has a Supertest integration test.
- Coverage Gate: Minimum 80% line coverage enforced in CI pipeline.
- Test Naming: describe('<ClassName>') → it('should <behavior> when <condition>')

