## 🔐 SECTION 7: SECURITY STANDARDS

- Auth: JWT (access 15min + refresh 7d) with rotation on every refresh.
- RBAC: All routes decorated with @Roles() guard. No unguarded endpoints in production.
- Rate Limiting: @Throttle() on all public endpoints. 100 req/min default.
- Helmet: Applied globally for HTTP security headers.
- SQL Injection: Prevented by Prisma parameterization — no raw query strings.
- PII Encryption: phone, nationalId encrypted at rest using AES-256-GCM.
- Password Hashing: bcrypt with saltRounds: 12 minimum.

